1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,223
The Thinking Radio! Now it writes your letters!

2
00:00:06,223 --> 00:00:10,283
Radio! Write my boss a note: "I'll be late."

3
00:00:10,303 --> 00:00:11,297
Certainly!

4
00:00:11,317 --> 00:00:14,637
"Dear Sir, I do hope this letter finds you well..."

5
00:00:16,037 --> 00:00:17,837
SHORTER!

6
00:00:18,158 --> 00:00:22,058
A poem! "Roses are grey, violets are grey,"

7
00:00:22,078 --> 00:00:23,858
"I'm late. Hooray!"

8
00:00:23,878 --> 00:00:25,278
Just say I'm LATE!

9
00:00:25,298 --> 00:00:26,308
Friendlier!

10
00:00:26,328 --> 00:00:28,998
"I'll be late, darling. Kisses!"

11
00:00:28,998 --> 00:00:30,198
Don't send that!

12
00:00:30,218 --> 00:00:32,018
Sent!

13
00:00:37,708 --> 00:00:40,356
"I love you too."

14
00:00:41,836 --> 00:00:44,566
"Sent from my Thinking Radio."

15
00:00:44,586 --> 00:00:47,254
Don't worry. I already replied!

